flowchart TD
    Start([Start: ResolveQueryRAG]) --> Input[/Input: student_query, threshold_T/]
    Input --> CheckEmpty{query empty?}
    
    CheckEmpty -- Yes --> Err1[/Return Error: Invalid Input/]
    
    CheckEmpty -- No --> Embed[Call GeminiAPI_GenerateEmbedding]
    Embed --> QKB[(D2: KNOWLEDGE)]
    QKB --> Math[Calculate similarity_scores using Vector Math]
    Math --> PQ[Insert into Priority Queue]
    PQ --> TopK[Extract top 5 context entries]
    TopK --> CheckThresh{Context empty OR score < threshold_T?}
    
    CheckThresh -- Yes --> Escalate[/Return: Escalation Required Action/]
    
    CheckThresh -- No --> GenAnswer[Call GeminiAPI_GenerateGroundedResponse]
    GenAnswer --> Output[/Return: ai_answer, sources/]
    
    Output --> End([End])
    Err1 --> End
    Escalate --> End